cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this platform in research or writing, cite it as below."
title: "Tianji (DU) — Local-Only Chinese Metaphysics Master Arena"
abstract: >-
  A local-first evaluation platform for Chinese metaphysics readings. Three
  verified fact kernels (Zi Ping four pillars, Mei Hua Yi Shu, Zi Wei Dou Shu)
  answer the same question under blind conditions; users score before the
  methods are revealed, and dated falsifiable claims are tracked in a local
  ledger. All computation happens on the device — no question, birth data,
  chart, reading, vote or claim is transmitted. Sex is treated as a calendar
  input that decides decadal direction, never as a prediction target.
version: 0.6.0
